  "title": "Logistic Properties of the Americas Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Results",
  "summary": "Sustained Growth Momentum, with Revenues Growing 26.1% YoY and NOI increasing 27.0% Logistic Properties of the Americas (NYSE American: LPA) (together with its subsidiaries, “LPA” or “the Company”) announced today its unaudited consolidated financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026 (“second quarter 2026” or “2Q26”). The financial results are expressed in U.S. dollars and are presented in accordance with International Accounting Standard (“IAS”) 34 - Interim Financial Reporting",
